# Names that must never appear in this public repo, one extended regex per line, matched case-insensitively.
# Copy to scripts/denylist.local (gitignored) and fill it. Keep the real list out of git: publishing it would
# publish the names.
#
# Personal hosts and domains
\bmy-server\b
example-private\.site
#
# Employer products, clients and colleagues under NDA
\bInternalProduct\b
\bClientName\b
